  "notes": [
    "This component is the real private Bucket<T> source type and real Links/HashValue/HeaderName field types.",
    "Bucket::field_ptrs borrows an initialized &mut Bucket before a value can escape; its permission tokens remain split by field. take_value consumes the value permission; hash/key/links remain available through disjoint field permissions.",
